# Digital formats

<https://dev.fiafcore.org/DigitalFormat> a owl:Class ;
    dc:description "The format of a digital object, comprising a single file or a unit of related files, such as a file container, an image file format, or a deliverable package. Read with software, independently of the storage medium holding it. Codecs describe individual digital streams rather than the format of the enclosing object."@en ;
    dc:source <> ;
    rdfs:label "Digital Format"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://dev.fiafcore.org/Format> ;
.

<https://dev.fiafcore.org/ContainerFormat> a owl:Class ;
